* Program to test ambiguous unqualified variable references (feature 27, T3).
* Two groups, each with a sub-field named #FIELD.
* An unqualified reference #FIELD should resolve to BOTH declarations.
PROGRAM AMBIG
DEFINE DATA
  LOCAL
    1 #GROUP-A
      2 #FIELD (A10)
    1 #GROUP-B
      2 #FIELD (A10)
  END
END-DEFINE
* Unqualified reference to #FIELD — ambiguous
MOVE #FIELD TO #FIELD

* Qualified references disambiguate
MOVE #GROUP-A.#FIELD TO #GROUP-B.#FIELD

END
